<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly steady. Demand and movement were both moderate. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country				 Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS. 54.50-55.50 Few 54.25 &amp; 56.00  55.00-56.50 US 2-3  230-260 LBS. 49.50-53.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS. 44.50-49.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Mostly steady. Top 48.50. US 1-3  300-500 LBS. 42.00-45.00 Few 41.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS. 45.00-47.50</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS. 47.50-48.50</p>
